{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1408,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fff148f4004f640a405fcdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この肩章、もふもふで\r\n柔らかいんですよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba65bd505a15ddd60271dfe252ad083563c71d16d8a4807e29096f5fbbd34642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec04c08f1779896a2eeb9e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0fcac5180dde021500aa860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恥じない努力を重ねてきました！\r\nさあ、真っ向勝負っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcb70f34973fee86e83292d8768ccc625fbd2c4a5674dc7cccb607e8c95a665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2266cc91f918a6058a6b296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ええい、勝負はこれからっ！\r\nお祭り娘の根性、お見せします！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0c7b2a348d9e060f711a2ae432c3dfa26869055333e090045fb270f1880731",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f768d685be3c5c9a5d4b266",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安啊！\r\n嘿嘿，我常常被称赞\r\n打招呼时很有精神喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed73b79ab050b5eff0b3b595b05c548bb0dabdc99bfab6731eeb18cea808522",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b2c4374afd3047d0b9e614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常帮助有困扰的人，\r\n有时会因此差点迟到……\r\n是否该再提早三十分钟起床呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b5ae2cfcf7cfafce9264e35c6d72e7c4ce6484a5c40360d95a6334d73a234d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da4111ed736d528861995cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，已经中午了呢！\r\n该去「热心助人」\r\n帮忙朋友解决问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82887d405b3206801488bbfb9db19b7eec83930a0dbfc75a24f7b1db638f130b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a923bb242e8b8dcdb7460bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下课后我要跟班上同学们\r\n一起去玩！交给我炒热气氛啰～\r\n嘿呀，嘿呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b6b7bd71123004fdf22f55f3942b325017a507417e85936cd128257dfcbf7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d086ce8f08d9e591d5e2b78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的浴室回声很大，\r\n害我总忍不住想高歌～\r\n有时候还会大家一起合唱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a22ad02ac43381f1ed397d1c4d3d060fa4b93c0312cca7b4a1018bd8eb4f8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fccb900441da8ddd5f939cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算对体力有信心，但晚上还是要\r\n乖乖睡觉喔！我有时候也会\r\n害小钻为我担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3c56d1605ab1de9e40589d243cfdec18e0a413fade1e1695093502712b34aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a5ccf0cc0e58ccf4f9e196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就会想到樱花呢！既壮观\r\n又不留恋地凋谢……不过我最喜欢的\r\n还是大家都会露出笑容这点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dfa1b38bf042e6e13089c9d77aa39057a934b3021d05393a679b7c3abd51234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88f44ed1cebb9a786eef35c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿呀！喝啊！嘿呀！\r\n……你问我在做什么？\r\n下次我要跟稻荷一起抬神轿喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b70c28bb8beab447046bdbba8bbda747a81b71837e47bbc2e8832cba3e32939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d774d673f35f72c7eafe7e3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天已经尽情游了泳，所以我在想\r\n下次去爬山好像也不错。\r\n带上巨大的饭团，约大家一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c357833f76ed7072738c557f9347da8db153f58b69236d1af816ed3825848eaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a77e518c4ea3a341e35d554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气冷害得你身体僵硬吗？\r\n我来教你妈妈亲自传授的按摩术吧，\r\n这样就能防止受伤啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "634e947e534c245d6ed20b5709481054d44f9853fd02fee7d401a3de590bc194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eca7362059491394fb3949e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近开始会上杂志，所以一大早\r\n就会被粉丝包围，虽然很开心……\r\n但我也希望能有时间跟小钻说话啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "019543fc558f34b1607bdb139139e2d801519e11973a80dd1478b8da6e09eb8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac6145df9615419e7fb771e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天早起，用抹布把宿舍走廊的\r\n地板擦干净了！真怀念以前和\r\n弟子们一起热闹打扫的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d36981d0cb28108b1b87259a583bea13640571d700a1b2db0dfc92d6affa6647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053e3c8a2c24ea8abf3201c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来对打陀螺很有自信的……\r\n没想到草上飞那么厉害！\r\n好～休息时间来特训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b405226911ecbc197ed58cb2c3aea0ea7010194e479ae2fd5fca66a6e642761",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4b11b84f954c76fad735f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮忙过祭神仪式后，\r\n就觉得历史课变得比以前有趣了！\r\n意志会持续流传，真是浪漫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3390fd3d9663bcb2468b820b2ecaeb210c86fc6b10ac705882cfc205424a0bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b6a898062cf4f16f5c4035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说以前的赛马娘巫女会禁食，\r\n那样真的没问题吗？\r\n我应该无法忍受不吃晚餐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "494bdc58aa2049f5007f4e92013ec9f9962b9ede5fcc8734c35fe0ba9b476713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f629650b31fe86b8251cb8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小心火烛！参加祭神仪式时，\r\n我再次体会到火的强大与可怕。\r\n我去巡一下火源！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46fc18eb2578297a57c03164dff57bda04595b546348ca0e92e2d2e3cc5a6cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1474281de0c122c7339ad7c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把健行的说明事项\r\n发给新生们了！学园后山的\r\n风景很棒，大家一定会很开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23194899d54c51e88ed375999dd487bf56d9e303f71c662325eca16e29461ce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87e070e2988cd73e521f3b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服毛茸茸的部分底下\r\n变得能放保冷剂了！\r\n是很棒的改良呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e2c0b52f05a1538866e510508b4a7b6b1d4a5bbcd9d8a2be09074dfd042752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6cf99fdea3d603f0d73dd2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待去山上采收柿子。\r\n今年一定要和黄金船一起\r\n迭出一百层的柿子塔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0372fc1c4f45217e0df5c10b1fd3cec753c6865403a9554edb1c06013cb9db5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dc20d4752bf28aa09a4e268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起生篝火吗？\r\n火焰不只能够取暖，\r\n还能驱除不好的东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "215f678ba0fd329ed4af67f18094c9cf39767a3837e7cd9239cb671f3c1bec4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3e66bc604f14969c8b5f7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38d1deb2a7a801a79c8405c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a06ea578955bd9366320db0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一天从问候开始！为了能\r\n成为让大家都喜欢的明星\r\n…还请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efaa180ff11c1edb499dc458677b976d0a1b56aa1a35f5d37946c4563522e51a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4e43d8243f4f6c5d5a0854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的胜利女神～♪…\r\n啊，要一起来做发声练习吗？\r\n从早上开始能让头脑很快清醒过来哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c31a6f5d028656fd7b942c8b78abedb7d12475d83136c843b116a1fb7f9536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec404bb7a3e29b2cc3ce0a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落雁、和三盆、琥珀糖♪\r\n说吧！今天的零食\r\n要吃哪种日式糕点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75a6f655648f0b4e29611471745293651eda14bf7be96e6646b47d39ccfeb922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de8605a0ebe2949c4e1ba9a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀！就算再忙 也不能忘记\r\n吃午饭的哦？对于我来说\r\n吃胡萝卜饭可以让我精神百倍♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "072611dcaa49c810005735a54f1db283d12d781812d708abe66aa22c38fab5e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad8fe7cef1e8d0db15a6187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摇啊摇啊～快睡吧～♪…诶嘿嘿、\r\n我唱摇篮曲很拿手的！说不定\r\n我也能让训练员你睡个好觉哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8ede3663e396cedcb46d164c91d01feca143ee1098ea291ca74bd869226362",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9a4eae6faa90905877db9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看！外面的月亮，\r\n就和舞台上的聚光灯一样…这时要是\r\n一起跳舞 说不定会有当演员的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ff05135b75185942fda433b73b11210edd577fa90aabc5ea27df02d25c8902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3eca6c6f445ded4da2fd5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想和大家一起看鲤鱼旗呀。\r\n爸爸妈妈，弟子们和小钻，\r\n还有训练员！真是个大家族呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f90b0d6d22454daf4814984e43d952af1f8e90b43f24e333c78248358549232",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45160c24200d9285b7843049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来，有试胆大会的活动…\r\n但、但是也有温柔的幽灵对吧！\r\n要是一起唱歌的话说不定能成为朋友…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db907a873a8f297c5e11a7cef312642dcfc4c01ea7955a69da89bc11f9f0a265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4bbda9f21ea2b25701386a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身决胜服，和鲜红的枫叶\r\n简直一模一样！说不定能通过我\r\n来赏枫呢…开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b937d458e4d84507e9e173c2e4b960b1ba0430acafeb77d485c54f12f29d6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00842bf9b8049e4e3a5534b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灯彩装饰真漂亮啊！\r\n大家就像过祭典一样洋溢着幸福…\r\n连寒冷都能一扫而空呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa455ed4f8178532e645ae439184e145500d93600e3f8715063917a12e72b12e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6834d003d0ec078e04acb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41cf6a91760b375b76d48376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次那场比赛……实在太精彩了……\r\n我现在还上不了台面，但总有一天\r\n我一定要像帝王一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4f71bb0968fcc8d68204fa8edbcbd398dea00b4428191438520d9ec3e4e19d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1427c083d83192a817dd88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唱歌练习我也不想落下！\r\n我也想跟爸爸一样，用歌声感谢\r\n支持着我的粉丝们……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8106695700a704b9df967b602c7aea061ba2395cddd80f76df84fb779344608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0769fd98c8febaf248dc34c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀在漆黑夜空中的烟火──\r\n魔法少女玄驹！……这句口号\r\n能通过变革的合格标准吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7727717e4b1001ba05afe6485dd2df79a57feb08f2dcbcbe0e932ea5c0c1d86b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:455d0fcc9990d5d5e1e46b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近我在挑战能不能用尾巴举重……\r\n训练员，可以麻烦你横躺一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e79eef9fc3521337736f3bc7815597622cc7c63d440d578208b6f4b3862fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c2ec197caa500ad6965767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算怀疑我究竟是在助人还是\r\n多管闲事……但最后还是会出手。\r\n我觉得这样比较不会后悔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e517a17bcc37ae51f38febc8e85c5b4836c5b646c37a1bf641ab173695f9d41a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdb16f91473ade03f3a49b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦，你说我的肚子看起来很冷……？\r\n没问题的！\r\n我的优点就是身体强健！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9edc13d17159ef0c670d76180d8f738af939ea577a8b716aa026d9d8c7177aaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9f297720fc0a9587e0924d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我老是觉得\r\n这对我来说太过成熟了……\r\n真想早点变得配得上它！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a64f1bb02cbd7ba014324be2c39f693bfee51b42f9f9e9cdedf50c1a6a8e3a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4718731401422bb0f22f073e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使用大量花朵的设计令人联想到\r\n盛大日子，能提醒自己认真起来呢。\r\n很好～要炒热气氛啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff9d0c4aaafccda313c0bcb1d9717aa1f427f1eee4d62eb6e7bfa2c98e666d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dae932539fa1754a4228ba3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第一次穿上这套衣服那一天的事……\r\n我绝对不想忘记。因为我认为\r\n这就是梦想的起点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbd28c6eda7734563472abbf7aecc15086456cf3ef062723f4b88bd62e0d192",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6f55a000f4785de15b2aa9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上有位饲主来请我帮忙，\r\n我就和逃跑的小狗追逐了一阵子！\r\n充分运动了一番呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "694abd23c22abfb5761c35a820bf39eafb01449bf0c0d57096903946754f03f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc8b0b25d30211624e0d848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问你有看到黄金船吗？她答应我，\r\n只要玩捉迷藏赢过她，\r\n就会陪我并跑练习当奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be457dd831428f7a0f82fbcfacd35c479ff4203563805c00a2f7f4f6ef112a6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d168a5b7f6c2a3c9abec4e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恥じない努力を重ねてきました！\r\nさあ、真っ向勝負っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcb70f34973fee86e83292d8768ccc625fbd2c4a5674dc7cccb607e8c95a665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98918a3935cd18b0ce5f404c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间爸爸他们应该在吃晚餐了？\r\n……嘿嘿嘿，看来我\r\n好像有点想家了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ebbc47e081537a0addc92d12c25303ba38871661515b284a9c5fefeafda588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69cf29edd71469c535255fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿，刚刚进王送我樱饼呢！\r\n她说「优秀的我本人\r\n送春天来了！」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f731ee8fa83116093ff5180b0cdf5ebac36f823888032ef4b46adb78ac10a9d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f68fee389ea3b2093c3cc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀～全身都是汗！今晚我要\r\n唰地一声跳进澡堂的热水中！\r\n──嗯嗯，真是期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6148adf38b9fe356376aa93c97f738fe2d5cc86a9e06b474a699d0646bbe90ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beea75a6e19abbf7ecfffe3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船约我一起去割稻……\r\n但割稻为什么需要准备\r\n游泳圈跟搅拌器呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a804d212e7c58032af154a4918d03cd14228cfd3f871ce2e2b3010fa5c025baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198acc01d0cda4dc0fe236bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的手就算在冬天还是很温暖！\r\n双手冰冷时就由我来帮忙温暖，\r\n所以请记得要叫我喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac5a50c46a9bf8d81219a2f953d8fbea2c24992230255e38631961ad295c5bb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2684168dc8384c2b6546a606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和玉藻一起去唱卡拉OK后，\r\n发现有她帮忙助兴就会唱得很痛快！\r\n她很会配合我的节奏呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e230d269ef565c20179ed7dcb32bb858e7adcdfd3ad432912639a7e40b71d122",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55547837fdc0aa7e8551060f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变革打算用魔法让纸鹤飞起来，\r\n所以我就去帮忙了！\r\n今天也要折很多纸鹤～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28ca75a678bdd6aa645bd3e48a7afe6d4accc046bf58a77f622d3ed40ecc3cb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b80c547c8b861ed5b475cce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "草上飞帮我换装的时候，\r\n我的站姿都会变得很端正！\r\n会自然地挺起胸膛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2817f3f9cba3bb3507cb9b89f89d280f17a26b61205d170db5e9bc698f7aaf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f5dde408dac2e52e8af03a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深夜察觉餐厅那里有动静，然后\r\n在一片黑暗中……发现正在吃夜宵的\r\n特别周！她后来还分了我一点喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "671c48e80aad260078b611e48725109d81548a99f4c6e81bc36a617dc5d6633f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d4987f58a448177b6c7ddf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第一次和小钻一起去\r\n古早味零食店时，她差点想把\r\n整间店都买下来！吓我一跳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51a055ee9752113265f80b4f1dc52d6a9164f640463f8bcab790d20a2e53926",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40f7999d79553109664b8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起床小钻就在身边，\r\n这对我来说非常普通，\r\n但同时也是件特别的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4207c16fb0fdea428db7a7f0e067ff7f87f26ed85d938226c1c5d978b95f976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d22f07eef75139e4591a3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "记得小钻为了杂志的摄影，下足功夫\r\n准备有益于调理肤质的饮食……\r\n……嗯，我也来调整午餐的内容吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce79cb67596a7d5d4fd590569077577c9ee72e9541faca0039f8d8fff09012c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc1acee7cafbfacd32575a49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也要像以前的赛马娘巫女那样，\r\n用夜空来占卜明天的吉兆！……今晚\r\n夜色也很美，明天应该是个好日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a91fc38981feb9ffe98cf65d1674e79627da00d1242e99d7db6839e386c7a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d877297bdcb857df5131eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从入学以后，我的跑法和想法\r\n都改变了不少……但我和小钻\r\n是好朋友这件事，永远不会改变！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeada85eba494f5a1d47126f1e7c2127e6424640c1936e7be76f4d961cbab618",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c831eb3f47192637c42e0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小心中暑！\r\n我会用这些羽毛帮忙搧风，\r\n热的话就跟我说喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dea29a131cb88d0c709e3eeb90d9150de9de20e6e8a23f5f36560d3483b922e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd26d18ebbc2c7afe2d0d453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长打扫落叶！诀窍是靠\r\n奔跑时的风把叶子卷起来……\r\n如果有比赛，我或许能拿冠军喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1701fb9f719355417a716f81608a23117cb26f774659a1a1c211e801d8b735",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8fc113b46edff3be2fd53b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要「有韧性地」战胜严寒的天气，\r\n那吃年糕最适合！而且捣年糕\r\n还能让身体变得更暖和喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a157fb2556589b52590f8435b64dea80ccf4ec3cebf15ffa690c9bd94271a536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e13201bcc040da7a912be02f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰间的白羽毛能招来福气，\r\n黑羽毛则是能消灾解厄！\r\n因为很吉利，我都会忍不住去摸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca837021b35d0229f4544aceed0081978999dea499759df8bb7a21e5d042447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef5011cf191d5b4b15c4e0e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "替大家带来幸福啊……\r\n为了能配得上这件衣服，\r\n我要帮助更多的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4aea04a27baab8ea94701cfeb2744277a2cee2ba7a635e67ad5881916a27f27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ba2abea5c865ec02a05db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打成平手了吗…没想到\r\n会是这样一场激战…！下次的将棋\r\n我会赢过你的，小冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58b614034dd0719d482337d757714b63a5615dcd86416d6f0ac96bae4ced1fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd42d5bf7a9b7a62137f6a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…好想让小高也一起享受\r\n祭典呀。但她喜欢\r\n安静的地方…那 午睡祭之类的…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "418068ce2bda91d34d7b7ffbdc38c6d595bde30c3fc70aa60976c6627ec93c5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5a88907e8bc8d13da4a8549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为并跑训练的回礼帮大鸣同学\r\n按摩时再次意识到…她的双腿\r\n原来这么结实！我也不能输啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f78f90a5079ac93dc4928eece33d2c0154bc6063d01f5fa8fb7b12a07f3071b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7813fa1d7412f0a3ff735710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弟子们看到这身衣服时都哭着说\r\n『大小姐居然成了这么出色的明星』\r\n…啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41b4c1aae9577ab743cb282f7749c1846ded6e71d0ef2b6bb57b1fcff380739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d28cbe68fee572f6e270d32b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦～♪…啊！又在唱了…\r\n自从听完万籁同学的演奏后，\r\n总会忍不住想要唱歌呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7f3375dc5d682bc2781082859dc406d301effcdfbd171ee1f2acbe5b929d8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:457f2bdaa1758566c89a239d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也吃点西式早餐吧！虽然这样想，\r\n但我自己总是用不惯刀叉。\r\n…要不偷偷用筷子吃点吧…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b18b71dcce1dbe739067f05d018d46343fdad64789588e6743494367332cfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8347ed08b9ad506e9d9863ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的英语课，好像比平时\r\n变得更努力了些！因为我想让外国的观众\r\n也能感受到祭典的气氛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "245c6a0971aa7f9450db5834b39e9c086bca7f301b0bee093777f7e0b09a2a2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff086bfe2cf8b0a2dffc815f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚的宿舍特别热闹！\r\n尤其是小钻外出远征的时候\r\n真是帮大忙了呢。诶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e60e86a35cca552b1032c21b54ee90fd32fb53941196281cb37e1f42a8635a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56a5f5e3fd7fb96923d82b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真怀念啊，女儿节时妈妈\r\n给我做的金平糖！我总会\r\n忍不住吃太多被训…啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b19c0a2c0ffe7f0167de7bd89842f01c1187010dfed24c40f00f7cf1d30a30aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb63e7d5d68718b9bc95307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，长时间待在飞机上…！就算不擅长\r\n也要通过特训克服掉！目标是，\r\n和大家一起去外国度假！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4adae89e5bc1239ff52bc0c1edb0991b4dd1408f14b7ef97135db4bc743bcc86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
